Now game.js routing.

Update handleButton:
```js
function handleButton(id) {
  // 底牌按钮 trump-0 / trump-1 ...
  if (id.indexOf('trump-') === 0) {
    game.activateTrump(Number(id.slice(6)))
    return
  }
  // 选牌卡片 ts-<key>
  if (id.indexOf('ts-') === 0 && id !== 'ts-confirm' && id !== 'ts-skip' && id !== 'ts-back') {
    game.toggleTrumpSelect(id.slice(3))
    return
  }
  // 炼丹 brew-<key>
  if (id.indexOf('brew-') === 0) {
    game.brewPill(id.slice(5))
    return
  }
  switch (id) { ... }
}
```

And switch:
- 'start' → game.enterTrumpSelect('main')
- 'restart' → game.enterTrumpSelect('main')
- 'ts-confirm' / 'ts-skip' → game.start()
- 'ts-back' → game.toReady()
- 'dungeon' → game.status = 'dungeonselect'
- 'dg-blood' → game.enterTrumpSelect('blood')
- 'dg-again' → game.enterTrumpSelect('blood')
- 'dg-back' → game.toReady()
- 'alchemy' → game.status = 'alchemy'
- 'back' → game.toReady()

Careful: 'ts-' prefix check must come before generic. And 'ts-confirm' starts with 'ts-' so exclude.

Also 'dg-back' vs 'back'.

Let me rewrite handleButton entirely.

Also note: onStart only sets touch when playing — ok.

One more: after 秘境结算 (dungeonsettle), 底牌状态保留但无用。fine.

