- 'upgrade'/'dungeon'/'alchemy' → if acquisition: ignore
But 获客版 never sees ready screen anyway.

Simplest and most robust: in engine, add `this.menuLocked = false`, set from game.js at boot. Then in ui `getButtons` and `drawUi`, if `g.menuLocked` and status is a menu status, fall back to playing. That's convoluted.

